<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Host Marriott featured.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Host Marriott featured.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>CS First Boston said it named Host Marriott Corp its Featured Stock of the Week.</p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 3/4 to 18-15/16.</p>
